<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9f5cfff5">&lt;p&gt;
    Test scenarios are derived from defined requirements, business process, use cases, user stories and any other relevant
    information that captures solution functionality. In most cases, at least one scenario is developed for every testable
    requirement.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    When performing this task, consider the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What&amp;nbsp;functionality of the&amp;nbsp;solution needs to be verified?&amp;nbsp;This is often the description of the test
        scenario.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Are multiple scenarios required to validate&amp;nbsp;a requirement?
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
